<title>USA: Ventana Medical sets offering.</title>
<headline>Ventana Medical sets offering.</headline>
<dateline>TUCSON, Ariz. 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ventana Medical Systems Inc on Friday said it filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission a registration statement for the sale of 2,850,000 shares of common stock.</p>
<p>Of these shares, 1,850,000 shares will be offered by the company and 1,000,000 shares will be offered by certain stockholders. In addition, certain stockholders have granted the underwriters an option to purchase up to an additional 427,500 shares solely to cover over-allotments.</p>
</text>
